{"s":[[null,1,[["g",[["Desert_Festival.webp",320,[]]]],["p",["The Desert Festival is a ",["l","节日","festival"]," that takes place every year in ",["l","沙漠","the Desert"]," on ",["l","春季","Spring"]," 15th, 16th, and 17th. The festival officially starts at 10am each day, and requires the Bus to be repaired in order to visit the festival. ",["l","潘姆#Schedule","Pam's schedule"]," as bus driver varies from her usual schedule."]],["p",[["l","桑迪","Sandy"],"'s shop will not be open during the festival; however, the player may still enter the ",["l","绿洲","Oasis"],". The ",["l","沙漠商人","Desert Trader"]," is still present and her shop is accessible."]],["p",["Several challenges and attractions offer the ability to earn this festival's currency, ",["f","Calico_Egg.png",24]," ",["l","卡利科三花蛋","Calico Egg"],"s. Calico Eggs are physical items within the game that can be used to purchase items from the various shops during the Desert Festival. Eggs carry over from day to day. However, they will disappear from chests or inventory at the end of the festival and are not saved for the following year."]],["p",["The eggs can be sold in the ",["l","售卖","Shipping Bin"],", but they sell for 0g."]]]],["Attractions",2,[]],["The Races",3,[["p",["Throughout the day, players may bet on races. If a player's chosen contestant wins, they will receive 20 Calico Eggs. Each day, the first winning bet a player makes on Escar-go, the slowest contestant, will instead earn the player 100 Calico Eggs. Players may place bets from 10am, when the festival opens, until the start of the last race just after 10pm. The race will not run its course if the player is not in the main festival area, so players must wait for it to finish to see the results."]],["p",["The player can also cheat the race by giving the Suspicious Man next to the Oasis 1 Calico Egg in exchange for one of the race contestants of the player's choosing possibly losing the race."]],["p",["The 5 possible contestants are Speed Rooster, King Sting, Shoebiscuit, Escar-go, and Cactus Crawler. Only 3 contestants will race each day."]],["g",[["Speed_Rooster.png",48,["Speed Rooster"]],["King_Sting.png",48,["King Sting"]],["Shoebiscuit.png",48,["Shoebiscuit"]],["Escar-go.png",48,["Escar-go"]],["Cactus_Crawler.png",48,["Cactus Crawler"]]]]]],["Calico Egg Merchant",3,[["p",["The Calico Egg Merchant sells several accessories and furniture items, as well as various usable items. Some items are sold every day, while others are only available on certain days. Items with limited stock are replenished each day."]],["t",[[{"c":3,"h":1,"v":["Permanent Stock"]}],[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Price"]}],[[["f","Mystery_Box.png",48]],[["l","谜之盒","Mystery Box"]," (10)"],["20 Calico Eggs"]],[[["f","Mummy_Mask.png",48]],[["l","木乃伊头套","Mummy Mask"]],["120 Calico Eggs"]],[[["f","Blue_Bow.png",54]],[["l","蓝色蝴蝶结","Blue Bow"]],["50 Calico Eggs"]],[[["f","Dark_Velvet_Bow.png",58]],[["l","黑丝绒蝴蝶结","Dark Velvet Bow"]],["75 Calico Eggs"]],[[["f","Mega_Bomb.png",48]],[["l","超级炸弹","Mega Bomb"]],["15 Calico Eggs"]],[[["f","Spicy_Eel.png",48]],[["l","香辣鳗鱼","Spicy Eel"],"* (5)"],["10 Calico Eggs"]],[[["f","Crab_Cakes.png",48]],[["l","蟹黄糕","Crab Cakes"],"* (5)"],["10 Calico Eggs"]],[[["f","Eggplant_Parmesan.png",48]],[["l","帕尔玛奶酪茄子","Eggplant Parmesan"],"* (5)"],["10 Calico Eggs"]],[[["f","Pumpkin_Soup.png",48]],[["l","南瓜汤","Pumpkin Soup"],"* (5)"],["10 Calico Eggs"]],[[["f","Lucky_Lunch.png",48]],[["l","幸运午餐","Lucky Lunch"],"* (5)"],["10 Calico Eggs"]],[[["f","Woodcutter's_Weekly.png",48]],[["l","樵夫周刊","Woodcutter's Weekly"]],["100 Calico Eggs"]],[{"c":3,"v":["*Note: one of these five dishes is randomly chosen."]}]]],["d","Rotating Stock",[["t",[[{"c":3,"h":1,"v":["Spring 15"]}],[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Price"]}],[[["f","Strawberry_Seeds.png",48]],[["l","草莓种子","Strawberry Seeds"]],["5 Calico Eggs"]],[[["f","Sun_Dunes.png",48]],[["l","日照沙丘","Sun Dunes"]],["30 Calico Eggs"]],[[["f","Sandy_Ru